      "explanation": "$(x+1)^3 = (x+1)(x+1)(x+1)$. First $(x+1)(x+1) = x^2 + 2x + 1$. Then $(x^2+2x+1)(x+1) = x^3 + x^2 + 2x^2 + 2x + x + 1 = x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1$."
